OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry day with just the
OL,6,Fodd brief shower in places. A cloudy
OL,7,Fstart but sunny spells breaking
OL,8,Fthrough, especially in the south.
OL,9,FFeeling rather cool for August.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening with bright
OL,12,Fspells, the best of these in the
OL,13,Fsouth. Becoming cloudy in the west
OL,14,Fovernight with a few showers. Dry with
OL,15,Fclear spells in the east.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA mixture of bright or sunny
OL,18,Fspells and a few brief showers. Light
OL,19,Fwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
